flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Initialize display and drawing state]
    B --> C[Poll supported keyboard and pointer inputs]
    C --> D{New drawing input?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Map pointer position to framebuffer coordinates]
    E --> F[Draw brush mark]
    D -- No --> G{Recognized keyboard command?}
    F --> H[Refresh displayed drawing]
    G -- Yes --> I[Update selected setting or clear drawing]
    G -- No --> C
    I --> H
    H --> C
